{
  "reason": "Structured spreadsheets (including CSV/TSV, legacy templates, and WPS), documents, presentations, and XMind mind maps open in rich interactive viewers with structured save and Save As support while raw UTF-8 text-write endpoints continue to refuse overwriting binary archives.",
